      "body": "## Why\n\nContinue the interrupted Office qualification from the latest main while preserving all saved work. Calendar-relative spreadsheet conditions used local midnight boundaries against UTC serial dates, producing timezone/DST endpoint errors.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Start from main `482e0817`, retaining merged #151/#152 and the later German grammar, formatting and icon-spacing work.\n- Adopt the reviewed civil-date repair and eight regression tests from `2bfac9b2`.\n- Add braces to an inherited rendering-test statement so strict analysis passes; its condition and assertions are unchanged.\n- Recover historical evidence omitted from the squash, preserving its original source attribution.\n- Publish exact runtime recovery, independent reviews, complete failed-run evidence, bounded helpers and a reproducible recovery handoff.\n\nThe incoming review covered 190 branch heads / 152 PR heads, then 191 branches / 152 PR records. Separate native spaCy and alternate Office continuations remain explicitly identified.\n\n## Local validation\n\nCorrected frozen source: `9a7c80be00258def2dcae3bb288c28558c83aa72`.\n\n- Five strict analysis commands passed.\n- Formatting passed for 145 files.\n- All 117 Python controls passed.\n- Engine Zotero emitted 390 successful test events across 19 suites, then exited **255** with **errno 28 / no space left on device** during compiler disposal.\n- The workspace byte-integrity check also rejected a Flutter-root symlink/actual-path normalization. A fresh run must stabilize that configuration before snapshots; the original failure is retained.\n\n**Final qualification is not accepted. This PR remains a draft.** The execution workspace became unavailable after repeated disk exhaustion. Remaining canonical cohorts, 17 Node suites, two example tests, the three-timezone calendar matrix, document consumers and serial native thread sweep are pending.\n\nThe complete 638,988-byte attempt archive and helper archive were fetched back from this branch and independently SHA-256 checked. Publication succeeded without relying on local disk access.\n\n## Handoff\n\n- [Current status and evidence](https://github.com/CrispStrobe/quds_office_suite/blob/codex/office-local-qualification-20261118/docs/validation/office-local-20261118/README.md)\n- [Exact recovery instructions](https://github.com/CrispStrobe/quds_office_suite/blob/codex/office-local-qualification-20261118/docs/validation/office-local-20261118/recovery-handoff.md)\n- [Machine-readable verification](https://github.com/CrispStrobe/quds_office_suite/blob/codex/office-local-qualification-20261118/docs/validation/office-local-20261118/verification.json)\n- [Remote byte readback](https://github.com/CrispStrobe/quds_office_suite/blob/codex/office-local-qualification-20261118/docs/validation/office-local-20261118/review/remote-readback.json)\n\nNo GitHub Actions, workflow, check or status endpoint was queried, awaited or rerun. Checkpoints use `[skip ci]` and non-forced expected-head branch updates. No merge or release acceptance is requested.\n",
